  "description": "Closes #2694\nCloses #2590\nRelated to #2741 (already closed, same root cause)\n\nThis PR enforces default RBAC role assignments and ensures existing users receive appropriate access.\n\n* Added an idempotent Alembic migration to assign the **`platform_admin`** role to admin users with **global** scope and the **`viewer`** role to non-admin users and with **team** scope who currently do not have roles .\n* Added Alembic migration to expanded default permissions for **viewer**, **developer**, and **team_admin** roles to include `admin.dashboard` ,`gateways.read` ,`servers.read` and clarified viewer role access.\n* Implemented default role assignment during user creation, assigning the **`platform_admin`** role to admin users ith **global** scope and the **`viewer`** role to non-admin users with **team** scope\n* Updated the user creation workflow to automatically assign default roles and capture **`granted_by`** information for audit tracking.\n* Enhanced admin user creation to record the granting admin's email for audit purposes.\n* Updated the `create_user` method to support the new **`granted_by`** parameter.\n* Updated rbac.md file",
  "comments": [],
