      "body": "Reviewed and made some changes.\r\n\r\n- Expand `update_user` role sync to swap `platform_admin` <-> `platform_viewer`\r\n- Add `delete_all_user_roles` to `RoleService` and call it from `delete_user`\r\n- Use lazy-initialized singleton RoleService in EmailAuthService\r\n- Remove redundant create_user code and tests from PR https://github.com/IBM/mcp-context-forge/pull/2793 merge\r\n\r\nLGTM"
