      "message": "fix: address code review feedback for RBAC role assignment\n\n- Migration: assign global role (platform_viewer/platform_admin) even\n  without personal team; only skip team_admin when no team exists\n- Migration: add PostgreSQL JSONB cast for platform_viewer INSERT\n- Migration: update existing platform_viewer to converge permissions\n- Migration: fix docstring to say platform_viewer not viewer\n- Migration: add nosec B608 for parameterized query false positive\n- API: add granted_by audit trail to admin user creation endpoint\n- Services: fix _get_user_roles docstring to document three branches\n- Services: add \"does not commit\" note to delete_all_user_roles\n- Docs: change \"TWO roles\" to \"up to two roles\", note team_admin\n  is conditional on personal team creation\n- Docs: use PLATFORM_ADMIN_EMAIL setting instead of hardcoded email\n- Docs: fix missing space in permission list\n- Tests: remove unused mock_password_settings helper\n- Tests: update role service mocks for refactored create_user\n- Tests: fix caplog level for plugin client coverage test\n- Tests: add retry-with-reload for Playwright gateway table loading\n\nCloses #2694\n\nSigned-off-by: Mihai Criveti <crivetimihai@gmail.com>",
